    <statement><p>Find the derivative of 
<m>f(x)=e^{-5 x}\cdot\sin x</m></p>
<p><m>f'(x) =</m> <fillin characters="65" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-1\cdot 5e^{-1\cdot 5x}\sin\mathopen{}\left(x\right)+e^{-1\cdot 5x}\cos\mathopen{}\left(x\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><m>f'(x) = -5 e^{-5 x} \sin(x) + e^{-5 x} \cos(x)</m>



<m>\phantom{ f'(x) } = e^{-5 x} ( -5 \sin(x) + \cos(x) )</m>



</solution>
